{"96471a2c-59f3-4a08-be7d-640bc0c022a4":{"id":"96471a2c-59f3-4a08-be7d-640bc0c022a4","title":"Saigo ni Hitotsu Dake Onegai Shite mo Yoroshii Deshou ka","altTitle":"May I Ask for One Final Thing?","description":"The engagement between Scarlet, a noblewoman from a ducal family, and Second Prince Kyle was suddenly annulled during a ball. She had been falsely accused of harassing a girl called Terenezza, daughter to a baron, whom the Prince doted on heavily. Condemned by everyone around her and forced to burden all manner of crimes, she finally decided enough was enough.\n\n\"Before I leave here, may I please ask you just one last thing?\"\n\nAs the crowd threw their boos and jeers, and that good looking guy flung his insults── her palm spun like a drill and the ballroom floor was stained with blood. From her fists, their reckoning!","year":2019,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/96471a2c-59f3-4a08-be7d-640bc0c022a4/149f1fd9-59d6-4267-8ead-f6c7859945b5.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["tr","fr","pt-br","ar","id","en","es-la","ru","pl"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.83,"follows":93050,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.305Z","chapters":[{"id":"cae85d04-de29-4cd5-a7ea-6e9b853d8dca","number":"53","volume":"10","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2025-09-11T22:54:06+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"df7ead40-3004-4102-b7fb-cddb3d7a85d4","number":"52","volume":"10","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":21,"createdAt":"2025-08-09T12:15:00+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"fe33f7bf-62c9-4e95-950a-2c98e5e15116","number":"51","volume":"10","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2025-05-11T16:46:07+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"1396ca1d-db54-4c28-bb3c-a28cee38101e","number":"50","volume":"9","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2025-04-27T16:54:27+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"54128d82-6b57-4c3e-b3ef-62851220db4a","number":"